## Performance: Indexes Strategy

### Time-Series Queries (Critical for Analytics Dashboard)
```sql
-- For date range queries + project filtering
CREATE INDEX idx_analytics_metrics_project_date 
  ON analytics_metrics(project_id, date DESC);

CREATE INDEX idx_traffic_sources_project_date 
  ON traffic_sources(project_id, date DESC);

CREATE INDEX idx_search_console_project_date 
  ON search_console_metrics(project_id, date DESC);

CREATE INDEX idx_ai_crawler_logs_project_date 
  ON ai_crawler_logs(project_id, date DESC);
```

### Foreign Key Lookups (Fast joins)
```sql
CREATE INDEX idx_keywords_project 
  ON keywords(project_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_ai_search_project 
  ON ai_search(project_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_ai_search_keyword 
  ON ai_search(keyword_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_icp_profiles_project 
  ON icp_profiles(project_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_integrations_project 
  ON integrations(project_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_project_members_user 
  ON project_members(user_id);

CREATE INDEX idx_project_members_project 
  ON project_members(project_id);
```

### Search & Filter Optimization
```sql
-- For keyword searching
CREATE INDEX idx_keywords_term_trgm 
  ON keywords USING GIN (term gin_trgm_ops);

-- For bot tracking
CREATE INDEX idx_ai_crawler_logs_bot_name 
  ON ai_crawler_logs(bot_name);

-- For traffic source filtering
CREATE INDEX idx_traffic_sources_source 
  ON traffic_sources(source);
```

